# vLLM

> vLLM is a high-throughput, memory-efficient inference and serving engine for large language models.

## Core pages

- [Home](https://vllm.ai): vLLM project homepage and overview.
- [Blog](https://vllm.ai/blog): Technical articles, release announcements, model guides, and community updates.
